&lt;li&gt;Align prototypes with shared primitives and standards: feature flags, auth flows, auditability, multitenancy assumptions, and basic observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate workflows touching streaming/orchestration (Kafka/Temporal) and partner with Data/ML engineers when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship an adoption package: documentation, interfaces, schemas, and an integration backlog that reduces handoff friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years building production web applications and APIs in TypeScript (React/Next.js + Node).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product-engineering instincts: you can turn ambiguity into a tight 1–3 week prototype scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical API and data-layer skills (PostgreSQL; comfortable integrating search when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in Kubernetes/GitOps environments and maintaining good engineering hygiene (tests, CI, docs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security-conscious: you treat access control, privacy/PII handling, and audit expectations as part of “done.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to work in Germany; EU/NATO citizenship preferred for export-controlled projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time UI experience (WebSockets/WebRTC, collaborative editing, CRDT/OT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex visualization experience (graph/geospatial UX; Cytoscape/D3/Mapbox/Cesium).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some Python comfort for quick data/ML integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language (B1+) and/or experience with regulated or mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack: &lt;/strong&gt;TypeScript/React, Node, Go, Kafka/Temporal, Postgres/OpenSearch, Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
