&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with agent interoperability and tool protocols (MCP, A2A, AG-UI), control-plane concepts for asynchronous or long-running systems (queueing, retries, checkpointing), and feature-flagging or progressive-rollout systems including reliable kill-switches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience managing cost and capacity for LLM usage — routing, caching, and reserved-capacity planning with managed model providers&lt;/li&gt;
