&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with Python (the team&#39;s primary language)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, or similar) including function calling and structured outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with SQL for data exploration and building data-grounded AI workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-assisted development tools (Claude Code, Codex, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built something from zero to one. You&#39;re drawn to figuring out what to build, not just building what&#39;s specified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action. You ship quickly, learn from feedback, and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see projects through from prototype to production and care about what the client experiences, not what the code does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science, Mathematics, or another quantitative field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
